    "Dock": {
      "area": null,
      "description": "Waves crash a dozen feet below the creaking wooden beams you stand on. Massive iron nails hold the beams together, and the dock spans out twenty paces in either direction. One side is empty; at the other you see a modest ship, crew packing hurriedly. Behind you the fire rages in town, edging closer to the dock every moment.",
